Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

npm-switchyard is written in Go. The binary contains:

- the Go standard library, BSD-3-Clause license, Copyright The Go Authors.
- gopkg.in/yaml.v3, MIT and Apache-2.0 licenses.
- github.com/miekg/dns, BSD-3-Clause license.
- github.com/Microsoft/go-winio (Windows binary only), MIT license.

The Linux images are built FROM scratch and contain only the npm-switchyard
binary. The Windows images are based on Microsoft Nano Server.
